		(property "Description" "FTDI FT2232HL Dual USB-UART/MPSSE Bridge, LQFP-64. Channel A = MPSSE JTAG to the FPGA (ADBUS0-3 = TCK/TDI/TDO/TMS, ADBUS4/5 = PROG#/DONE). Channel B = UART (BDBUS0-4 = TXD/RXD/RTS#/CTS#/DTR#). Same pin numbering as the FT2232HQ, no exposed pad. Replaced the FT2232HQ on 2026-09-09."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
